                                                            <p>
                                                                St. Anne's School, Chhoto Jagulia, North 24 Parganas, West Bengal is established In 2018, owned by the Society of S of Sisters of St. Anne, Chennal, a body registered under the Society Registration Act1860. It is a Catholic Educational Institution conducted by the Sisters of St. Anne, Chhoto Jagulia a branch of the Society of Sisters of St. Anne.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                The Society of Sisters of St. Anne is working practically in all over India through education Institutions, Health Centers, orphanages and other charitable and promotional works. The School admits all children irrespective of caste and creed.
                                                            </p>
