                                                                      style="animation-name: o_anim_zoom_in; animation-play-state: running; visibility: visible;">VISION AND MISSION.....</span></h3>
                                                            <p>
                                                                1. The aim of the School is to impart to its pupils sound education and discipline based on moral principles and instill in them the spirit of service and joy and make them useful members of the Society.
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                <br></br>
                                                                2. It works with the Charism of the Society of Sisters of St. Anne, "Fullness in God and Service in Simplicity" by inculcating in them the fear of God, Self-confidence, honesty, sincerity, equality and fraternity. We shall see that every pupil in our School is formed to be a good leader, responsible citizen.


                                                            </p>
                                                        </div>
