                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div>
                                                    <p>
                                                        3. The constant effort of the well trained staff is to develop the individual personality of each pupil and bring out those qualities which are best and noblest in them. Special attention is given to ensure a value-based education. In order to enable the child choose the higher values of life, such as respect, love, peace, justice, goodness and brotherhood.
