                                                            <p>
                                                                The Society of Sisters of St. Anne is a Pontifical Congregation. It was chiefly founded for the empowerment of the powerless, the poor and the marginalized. This vision of the Congregation springs from the life and work of the Foundress Thatipathri Gnanamma.
                                                            </p>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="align-self-stretch s_media_list_img_wrapper col-lg-6">
