                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                                <div>
                                                    <p>
                                                        The sensitivity to the cry of the poor and creative response to the signs of the times defines the core identity of the Congregation. This drives the Sisters to engage themselves in liberative, empowering and life-giving mission for the marginalized involving in many ministries - social, spiritual, cultural, pastoral, medical, educational that manifest in concrete actions the word of God.
                                                    </p>
